    "config_text": "tram_odometry:\n  ros__parameters:\n    vehicle_id: 30618\n    output_frame_id: mgrs_37UCB\n    relative_frame_id: odom\n    output_projection: mgrs37ucb  # x=UTM37 easting-300000, y=northing-6100000\n    child_frame_id: base_link\n    route_direction: auto  # out, return or auto; auto needs a valid startup GNSS fix\n    map_file: ''           # empty: installed assets/route_map.csv\n    alternate_map_file: '' # empty: installed branch A; 'none' disables branch selection\n    elevation_file: ''     # official base_link height; 'none' keeps train map height\n    enable_gnss_corrections: true\n    gnss_correction_max_age_s: 0.5\n    gnss_correction_gate_m: 40.0\n    gnss_correction_lateral_gate_m: 8.0\n    gnss_correction_gain: 0.5\n    gnss_correction_max_step_m: 3.0\n    start_s_m: 0.0        # used if GNSS initialization is unavailable\n    use_startup_gnss: true\n    use_map_without_gnss: false  # true only with configured direction/start_s_m\n    use_rover_fallback: true\n    startup_gnss_window_s: 5.0\n    startup_min_fixes: 3\n    rover_fallback_delay_s: 1.5\n    rover_to_master_s_m: -12.436  # official rover-master longitudinal offset\n    map_match_max_distance_m: 50.0\n    auto_out_terminal_min_x_m: -200.0\n    auto_return_terminal_max_x_m: -4400.0\n    anchor_residual_decay_m: 100.0\n    route_longitudinal_offset_m: 9.873  # rigid master\u2192base_link offset along 3D body tangent\n    body_heading_lookahead_m: 6.098   # master\u2192bogie midpoint: 9.873 - 7.55/2 m\n    antenna_to_base_z_m: -3.0         # both GNSS antennae z=+3 in base_link\n    relative_heading_rad: 0.0\n    initial_x_m: 0.0\n    initial_y_m: 0.0\n    initial_z_m: 0.0\n    output_rotation_rad: 0.0\n    output_scale: 1.0\n    wheel_common_scale_sigma: 0.01  # train-only prior for shared wheel-scale drift (dimensionless)\n    output_offset_x_m: 0.0\n    output_offset_y_m: 0.0\n    output_offset_z_m: 0.0\n    # Must match the WGS84 ECEF->ENU datum used to build assets/route_map.csv.\n    map_datum_lat_deg: 55.810367065\n    map_datum_lon_deg: 37.462266845\n    map_datum_alt_m: 168.3794\n    reset_on_large_time_jump_s: 60.0\n    # The model and robust fusion defaults come from EstimatorConfig::forVehicle(id).\n    # Optional ROS overrides: front_scale, rear_scale, mass_kg, effective_wheel_radius_m,\n    # motor_torque_max_nm, traction_power_limit_w, brake_force_max_n,\n    # rolling_resistance_accel_mps2, quadratic_drag_accel_per_mps2,\n    # grade_accel_mps2, wheel_stale_s, max_out_of_order_s, disagreement_gate_mps,\n    # innovation_gate_mps, implausible_wheel_accel_mps2, wheel_sigma_mps,\n    # process_accel_sigma_mps2, enable_adaptation,\n    # pair_freeze_min_duration_s (0.5),\n    # pair_freeze_model_accel_threshold_mps2 (0.15),\n    # pair_freeze_distance_correction_limit_m (5.0),\n    # pair_freeze_correction_rate_mps (2.0).\n    # Train-only drive table is enabled by the node for vehicle_id=30618 and\n    # disabled for 30639; do not set a fixed boolean here, as it would override\n    # the vehicle-specific default. To override: enable_drive_table: false/true.\n    # Empty drive_table_path uses installed assets/drive_accel_table.csv.\n    # A missing or invalid file logs a startup warning and keeps physics-only\n    # prediction; check /result/diagnostics drive_table_active/used.\n",
